{"id":"631683","name":"鸡蛋拼盘","author":"沐祠姐姐","authorId":"12934813","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/631683/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3只"},{"name":"腰果","amount":"3只"}],"sub":[{"name":"清水煮","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡蛋食材。","img":"images/631683/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入蒸笼蒸十五分钟。","img":"images/631683/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"取出来用冷水浸泡三分钟。","img":"images/631683/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"剥去鸡蛋壳。","img":"images/631683/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"网上买了一个切蛋器。","img":"images/631683/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把剥好的鸡蛋放上去。","img":"images/631683/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"这样就切好了。","img":"images/631683/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"摆入盘中。","img":"images/631683/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"中间放几只腰果，鸡蛋拼盘就做好了。","img":"images/631683/step_9.jpeg"},{"step":10,"desc":"早餐搭配成品图。","img":"images/631683/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/631683/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}